### Car Rental API requests for JetBrains HTTP Client
### Start app first: ./gradlew bootRun

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@existingReservationId = 34efac00-e925-41fa-8888-3454ad8b409c
@missingReservationId = 99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### Create reservation - success
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carType": "SUV",
  "startDateTime": "2026-11-25T10:00:00",
  "numberOfDays": 2
}

### Create reservation - invalid request (missing carType)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDateTime": "2026-11-25T10:00:00",
  "numberOfDays": 2
}

### Create reservation - conflict example (run after filling a type/time window)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carType": "VAN",
  "startDateTime": "2026-11-25T10:00:00",
  "numberOfDays": 2
}

### Get reservation by id - expected 200 after you use a real id from create response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{existingReservationId}}

### Get reservation by id - expected 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{missingReservationId}}

### Check availability - success
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/availability?carType=SUV&startDateTime=2026-11-25T10:00:00&numberOfDays=2

### Check availability - invalid request (days <= 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/availability?carType=SUV&startDateTime=2026-11-25T10:00:00&numberOfDays=0

